                    <h3>Optional Plugins</h3>
                    <p>Modified Termux:Styling, Termux:API, Termux:Boot and more are available for the fork.</p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Termux-Monet/repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
